OL,3,GNEWSAStaff 'wrestle' firearm from man
OL,4,Ain failed heist
OL,5,
OL,6,FA would-be robber left a shop
OL,7,Fempty-handed after a staff member
OL,8,F"wrestled" a suspected firearm from
OL,9,Fhim.
OL,11,FThe attempted robbery happened at the
OL,12,FFamily Shopper Convenience Store in the
OL,13,FShiney Row area of Houghton-le-Spring
OL,14,Fat about 11:45 GMT on Monday.
OL,16,FNorthumbria Police said a man carrying
OL,17,Fa suspected firearm entered the shop on
OL,18,FMill Terrace, but a staff member
OL,19,Fmanaged to "wrestle the weapon" from
OL,20,Fhis hands outside the premises after
OL,21,Fattempting to lock him inside.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,400,390,260,160,0,100
